# ── 機密(絕不進版控)──
.claude/secrets.local.json
**/secrets.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.pfx
*.key

# 相依套件尚未發佈、暫時以本機 feed 還原時,NuGet.config 會把還原目的地指到這裡;留著忽略規則,免得殘留目錄進版控。
# When a dependency is not yet published and a temporary NuGet.config restores from the local feed, it points the
# restore target here; the rule stays so a leftover folder never lands in version control.
/.nuget-packages/
